IMAPAccount personal
Host imap.gmail.com
User personal@example.com
PassCmd "oama access personal@example.com"
AuthMechs XOAUTH2
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore personal-remote
Account personal

MaildirStore personal-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.local/share/mail/personal/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/personal/INBOX

Channel personal
Far :personal-remote:
Near :personal-local:
Patterns "INBOX" "[Gmail]/Sent Mail" "[Gmail]/Drafts"
MaxMessages 1000
ExpireUnread yes
ExpireSide Near
Create Near
Remove None
Expunge None
Sync Pull
SyncState *

